        <mxCell id="c103" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: the two parenthesized groups. Each pairs the account types with the normal balance that is opposite to them, and the OR joins two complete tests. The 8 rows are the contra accounts: 5 with a credit balance under an Asset or Expense type and 3 with a debit balance under a Liability, Equity or Revenue type.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="688" width="860" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
